{"login": "wingertge", "location": "Germany", "commits": [{"sha": "0d8045824814e1d8784ee117fdd6bb2ab0061814", "message": "Add AppVeyor Build", "created_at": "2019-02-20T19:29:42Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6ef00ae07d306b423f839bb97a770cefc4ab4adb", "message": "Add documentation and clean up accessibility as much as possible", "created_at": "2019-02-20T19:03:54Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "066d7e3860b47b443d35ac5d882f3c60d435eb77", "message": "Add Null safety on GetEnumerator(), Finalize query parser error testing, Clean up unused code.", "created_at": "2019-02-20T17:23:02Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e65815b9d9f42e5f1f866a56e9932e45c11ba021", "message": "Optimize local method call\n\nShorten code by using Lambda.Compile().DynamicInvoke()\nRemove FixLocalParameters function since it's now redundant.\nAdd appropriate unit tests.", "created_at": "2019-02-20T16:48:36Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6be7711847e355cb10762b81224ac33b620dcb23", "message": "Optimize list inits\n\nAdd short circuit if list init is all local.\nAdd appropriate Unit Test.", "created_at": "2019-02-20T16:42:00Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f40e43b1c839a5ae6fea89bdeea87c18718ecff9", "message": "Fix bug in data side checking, test array initializer with database side data\n\nAdd checking for array/list initializer contents for side check.\nAmend Unit Test to include database side array initializer.", "created_at": "2019-02-20T16:34:46Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f431474ec0b9f53f095864c40cf09e6067cac9a2", "message": "Rewrite Type Binary Expression handling, Add Unit Tests to test it\n\nMake Binary Expression fail on database variables, run client side on non-database variables.", "created_at": "2019-02-20T16:25:50Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "078eca8add2491c2074a5d31ebe95e1b4e3e7122", "message": "Add custom serialization for tuples (as arrays), Revamp list initializers to support tuple collections, bug fixes, cleanup\n\nMethods using only local parameters should simply be run instead of translated into database queries, with the result being converted to a fauna object. As a result of this change, created Tuples are no longer serialized properly - add custom logic to turn them into arrays.\nClean up calls to IsDatabaseSide. Convert IsDatabaseSide from tail recursive function to loop.\nConvert local variables into Fauna Objects.\nNew expression is now never valid, replace it with UnsupportedMethodException.\nAdd previously unsupported unary operators (negation). Add more Unit Tests.", "created_at": "2019-02-20T16:17:08Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8d17ddfd0f8fe2426070c070e1879634593c1424", "message": "Remove unreachable code in IsParentReference function.", "created_at": "2019-02-20T14:14:22Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c434f13e02f7795377bac512522cdf4d4479004d", "message": "Fix bugs in member expression handling\n\nLogic to determine if parent is reference type is wrong, add new function to determine if value type or reference type syntax should be used. Update Unit Tests to reflect changes.", "created_at": "2019-02-20T14:13:20Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6d6f78141c28985c16854a4042a8f3740b079d95", "message": "Refactor Member Expression Handling for more efficient DB Queries, Add Collection Select Unit Test\n\nMember expression parsing has a redundant Map call that is already being added in the Select function - remove it.", "created_at": "2019-02-20T13:32:09Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2f3b7e65879fbe88d16097b72b9b544b95230a8c", "message": "Revamp Handling of MemberExpression and Local Parameter Fixing\n\nLocal member expressions are now simply compiled into a lambda and invoked to get their value - the code will only use database side functions for database side data. The new code has also been integrated into the local parameter fixing logic, to simplify queries and reduce database load.", "created_at": "2019-02-20T12:44:23Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8c387d3c423ac67c7890d0e5b2cd70ecfc25af83", "message": "Refactoring for clarity, Amend Unit Test to improve coverage", "created_at": "2019-02-19T17:34:32Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6b6d929bc0355382e6e804388fc8e87e80a021d0", "message": "Revert Changes made to FaunaQueryParser", "created_at": "2019-02-19T17:25:25Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "60ce777e07123057c5d1a52d3530c4e590868c96", "message": "Removed unreachable code, unit tested \"new\" expressions.\n\nCode involving constant fixing was invalid, MemberExpression.Expression can never be ConstantExpression.", "created_at": "2019-02-19T17:14:43Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b57a657a5191d94080976e2277070552b8256132", "message": "Removed Support for Block Expressions, more Unit Tests\n\nBlock Expressions aren't supported for lambda expressions and can only be constructed artificially, so supporting them isn't worth it.", "created_at": "2019-02-19T14:47:23Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a18046a744f6412196d966d157f57202c14e3b45", "message": "Move Power Binary Operator from Currently Unsupported to Unsupported since it can only be created artificially.\n\nAdd more Query Parser Tests", "created_at": "2019-02-19T14:09:41Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "19dee8a8fd6676a126269816dc8d4b49c4d771ce", "message": "Unit Testing Number the I don't remember", "created_at": "2019-02-18T22:38:09Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f552e8beb504b8842a0e42d526a14ff6528d0cee", "message": "Util Failure Testing", "created_at": "2019-02-18T17:07:56Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d5f2c4fa394ea206740cd3eaaef3b03887dc5c1b", "message": "Serialization Unit Testing and Bug Fixing", "created_at": "2019-02-18T16:50:19Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "57a98f74621ef6487a501dd2b606e9176b4e2e0b", "message": "More refactoring oversights and Unit Testing", "created_at": "2019-02-18T12:02:40Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7e9e4d4cc8701c7f328c053f0e8aa7e43803bbed", "message": "Messed up during last cleanup, reverted and fixed refactoring oversights. Also more Unit Tests.", "created_at": "2019-02-18T11:28:46Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "abfdf297940accabc3a288924c03753445df1717", "message": "More Unit Testing and Bug Fixes, Cleanup of Redundant Code", "created_at": "2019-02-17T23:28:03Z", "repo": "FaunaDB.CSharp", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1bec1a9d37bbbbbe367b8d22ce1bf0aba6ef6ac3", "message": 